'''Realm of Whyworry''' (帝政エイジャナイカ, ''Teisei Eijanaika'', '''Imperial Eijanaika''') is the 24th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 73rd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
One of the most difficult sub-chapters up to this point. Besides stages 3 and 4, all of these stages have the potential to be very challenging. The hardest is probably [[Bare Fangs at the Throne]], especially in higher crowns.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[St. Dober]]: A short-ranged [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy with a large health pool, attacks that reach past his target and a 1 in 3 chance to cause a powerful [[Surge Attack]].

