==Trivia==
*The theme of Realm of Whyworry is "tyrannical dictatorship", with references to [[Authority and Gravity|authority]], [[Slave to Energy|slavery]], [[Raise Your Torches|angry mobs]], [[Despotism at Home|despotism]], [[Unauthorized Breathing|authoritarian policies]] and [[Bare Fangs at the Throne|royalty]].
*The Japanese name of this sub-chapter, and possibly the sub-chapter as a whole, is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Ee ja nai ka|ee ja nai ka]]'' (ええじゃないか, ''Why not''), a complex of celebrations and festivities commonly understood as a form of political protest, which occurred in many parts of Japan from June 1867 to May 1868.
*Every stage has an overall trait. Authority and gravity has mostly [[Traitless Enemies]], Slave to energy has mostly [[Dark Enemies]], Raise Your Torches has only [[Alien Enemies]], Despotism at Home has mostly [[Floating Enemies]], Unauthorized Breathing has only [[Zombie Enemies]], Bare Fangs at the Throne has mostly [[Angel Enemies]].

